    "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/f/fd/Aranea_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20230722133555\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Aranea Queen&#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break \" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/f/fd/Aranea_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/400?cb=20230722133555\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"896\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Aranea Queen&#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break .jpg\" data-image-key=\"Aranea_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span>\n</p><p>沉默之影(しじまの影, Shijima no kage)\n\n</p><p>来自狩猎部落的战士，部落住在森林深处。穿着用细丝编织的衣服。她在森林的暗影中狩猎。当她挥舞锁镰时，如同织网的蜘蛛。\n\n</p>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"f6bfd105b5c889820f97e00c72f3aad6\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Aranea_SS_Race_Queen_Queen-s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break-jpg\" style=\"position: relative; height:184px; width:81px; top:0.5px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Aranea_SS_Race_Queen_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break.jpg\" title=\"Aranea SS Race Queen Queen&#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break.jpg (303 KB)\" style=\"height:184px; width:81px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/5/57/Aranea_SS_Race_Queen_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/81?cb=20251107142537\" title=\"Aranea SS Race Queen Queen&